{"ID":"20260206183337-lnb1wqb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"api/icon/getDynamicIcon?type=6\u0026amp;color=%23d23f31\u0026amp;date=2026-02-06\u0026amp;weekdayType=1\u0026amp;lang=","id":"20260206183337-lnb1wqb","title":"神经网络学习","type":"doc","updated":"20260207111537"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192820-otltgbs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192820-otltgbs","updated":"20260206203822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 基础神经网络架构学习"}]},{"ID":"20260206195039-harzpxh","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[2,0,2],"Properties":{"colgroup":"min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;","id":"20260206195039-harzpxh","style":"text-align: left;","updated":"20260206203747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"序号"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名称"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要简介"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260201125229-m656ezj","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"LeNet-5"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LeNet-5卷积神经网络的鼻祖。由Yann LeCun于1998年提出，主要用于手写数字识别（MNIST）。它确立了CNN“的经典结构，虽然网络较浅，但为现代深度学习的发展奠定了基础。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206191940-pxl4245","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AlexNet深度学习爆发的开端。2012年ImageNet竞赛冠军。它首次在大规模图像上使用ReLU激活函数、Dropout防止过拟合及GPU加速训练。其错误率的大幅降低证明了深层CNN的强大能力，引领了AI热潮。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192147-45jp7aq","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"VGGNet小卷积核与深度的代表。由牛津大学VGG组提出。其特点是结构简洁规整，全部使用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"3\\times3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小卷积核堆叠。通过加深层数显著提升了性能，其结构常被用作后续任务的特征提取骨干。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Properties":{"colspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192314-s2ofdp1","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"GoogleNet"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Properties":{"colspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GoogLeNet多尺度特征融合。2014年ImageNet竞赛冠军。它引入了Inception模块，通过并行使用不同尺寸的卷积核提取特征，在增加网络深度的同时有效控制了参数量和计算成本。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Properties":{"colspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192508-7vlgudd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Properties":{"colspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ResNet残差连接解决深层训练难题。2015年ImageNet竞赛冠军。针对深层网络梯度消失问题，提出了残差学习和跳跃连接，使得训练成百上千层的超深神经网络成为可能，是目前应用最广泛的网络之一。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206201501-cw8y94v","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"Network In Network"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Network In Network "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1\\times1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 卷积与全局池化的先驱。核心创新有两点：一是提出了“微网络”结构，首次引入 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1\\times1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 卷积 来增强非线性表达能力并降低维度；二是使用 全局平均池化 替代最后的全连接层，大幅减少了参数量并防止过拟合。这两项设计对后来的 GoogLeNet 和 ResNet 产生了深远影响。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Properties":{"colspan":"1","rowspan":"2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"1","rowspan":"2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206202357-gdymd2a","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"DenseNet"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Properties":{"colspan":"1","rowspan":"2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DenseNet极致的特征重用。CVPR 2017 最佳论文。其核心是密集连接，在一个模块内，每一层都直接接收前面所有层的输出作为输入。这种设计最大化了信息流和梯度传播，缓解了梯度消失问题，且相比 ResNet，它能以更少的参数量实现极高的性能，显著提升了特征利用率。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206195059-9sk3bbk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260206195059-9sk3bbk","updated":"20260206195059"}},{"ID":"20260206203822-2ceq7pn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260206203822-2ceq7pn","updated":"20260207111416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.注意力机制模块学习"}]},{"ID":"20260207111355-2fibgc2","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[2,0,2],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||","id":"20260207111355-2fibgc2","updated":"20260207111416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"序号"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名称"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要简介"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202164105-z33iw2s","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"SE Block"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LeNet-5卷积神经网络的鼻祖。由Yann LeCun于1998年提出，主要用于手写数字识别（MNIST）。它确立了CNN“的经典结构，虽然网络较浅，但为现代深度学习的发展奠定了基础。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202164417-17f8s7v","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"CBAM"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AlexNet深度学习爆发的开端。2012年ImageNet竞赛冠军。它首次在大规模图像上使用ReLU激活函数、Dropout防止过拟合及GPU加速训练。其错误率的大幅降低证明了深层CNN的强大能力，引领了AI热潮。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206203838-vabd4zc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260206203838-vabd4zc","updated":"20260206203838"}},{"ID":"20260206203848-zy8xsbj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260206203848-zy8xsbj","updated":"20260207111523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.目标检测相关框架学习"}]},{"ID":"20260206203902-97zh76k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260206203902-97zh76k","updated":"20260207111523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.1 R-CNN框架"}]},{"ID":"20260207111435-3dcjq81","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[2,0,2],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||","id":"20260207111435-3dcjq81","updated":"20260207111523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"序号"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名称"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":